cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper below and, for the code,
  this repository with the Git commit or tag you used.
type: software
title: "PINN-Research: estimator and experiment-design analysis for physics-informed and hybrid models of WNT-RA-HOX signalling"
abstract: >-
  Forward and inverse physics-informed neural networks, Cramér-Rao and Fisher
  identifiability analyses, converged maximum-likelihood and Schur-complement
  Gauss-Newton estimators, Bayesian experiments and neural-mechanistic hybrids
  for a seven-state WNT-retinoic acid-HOX model of colorectal cancer. All data
  are synthetic and regenerated from fixed seeds.
authors:
