repository-code: "https://github.com/aidxhxr/PINN-Research"
url: "https://github.com/aidxhxr/PINN-Research"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - Cramér-Rao bound
  - identifiability
  - experimental design
  - universal differential equations
  - systems biology
  - scientific machine learning
